    <div class="site-footer__brand">
      <img src="/branding/oob_horiz-flat-dark.png" alt="oobCREATIVE" width="230" height="53" loading="lazy" />
      <p>Go deeper, not louder.</p>
      <p class="site-footer__descriptor">Strategy, communication, websites, workflows, and practical AI built around human judgment.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="site-footer__links">
      <div>
        <p class="footer-label">Explore</p>
        <a href="/services/">Services</a>
        <a href="/#answers">Answers</a>
        <a href="/#work">Work</a>
        <a href="/#about">About</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="footer-label">Start somewhere useful</p>
        <a href="/#review">Find your first move</a>
        <a href="/#talk">Talk</a>
        <a href="mailto:hello@oobcreative.com">hello@oobcreative.com</a>
